{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_120_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_120","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，晉趙盾、衞孫免侵陳。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_120_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_120","textTraditional":"此帥師也，其不言帥師何也？不正其敗前事，故不與帥師也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_120_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_120","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_120_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_120","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，螽。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_120_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_120","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}